## Workspace .gitignore — substrate-L0 Erlang
## DO NOT commit sensitive material

## Erlang cookie (user-private; never in source)
.erlang.cookie

## Erlang build artifacts
_build/
.rebar3/
ebin/
deps/
*.beam

## ra runtime data — per-node persistent state, never in source control
## Pattern matches substrate_l0_*@<hostname>/ directories at workspace root
substrate_l0_*@*/

## Mnesia per-node data dirs — created by mnesia:create_schema/1; never in source
Mnesia.*@*/

## Crash dumps + core files
erl_crash.dump
core.*

## Editor + OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
